## Reached at
  The target is a Lua 5.4.0 interpreter: a C source tree staged by the image
  build at /app/lua-5.4.0 (fetched from upstream and built there with
  `make linux`), project-owned from the start of the task, together with the
  shipped interpreter binary built from that tree:
      /app/lua-5.4.0/src/lua
  Callers reach it as subprocesses spawned by absolute path, in two
  independent ways:

  1. The shipped binary, executed directly:
         subprocess.run(["/app/lua-5.4.0/src/lua", "-e", chunk], ...)
