- **Region boundary:** Self-contained: one complete function definition; nothing left open either way; no retained text in this file references the name. Retained `comps_objmdict_unite`, the header declaration, and external binaries bind `comps_objmrtree_unite`, so the replacement must define it at file scope. Mechanical consequences of the cut, not design guidance.
```

