Declared in `src/comps_radix.h`, exported by `libcomps.so`. Callers: retained `comps_rtree_union` below in this file; retained `src/comps_dict.c` (`comps_dict_union` via that union); external programs calling it and reading the first argument via `comps_rtree_get`.
