- **Region boundary:** Self-contained: one complete function definition; nothing left open either way. The retained `comps_rtree_union` below calls the name `comps_rtree_unite`, and the header declaration and external binaries bind it, so the replacement must define it at file scope. Mechanical consequences of the cut, not design guidance.
